  const envVars = fs.readFileSync(envPath, 'utf8')
    .split('\n')
    .filter(line => !line.startsWith('#') && line.trim());

  envVars.forEach(line => {
    const [key, ...valueParts] = line.split('=');
    process.env[key.trim()] = valueParts.join('=');
  });
}
```

This at least prevents the app from crashing if `.env` files don't match the expected pattern and provides basic separation.

